        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會出現在人類生活的地方。\n一旦撒出飼料就會有好幾百隻\n豆豆鴿聚集而來，千萬要小心。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On en trouve là où vivent les humains.\nMieux vaut éviter de les nourrir, sous peine\nd’en voir arriver des centaines.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es taucht dort auf, wo Menschen leben. Beim\nFüttern muss man vorsichtig sein, da sich sonst\nschnell hunderte von ihnen versammeln können.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aparece en lugares habitados por humanos.\nConviene tener cuidado al darles de comer, ya\nque esto podría atraer a cientos de ejemplares.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Appare dovunque vivano delle persone. Meglio\nessere prudenti quando gli si dà del cibo, perché\npotrebbero accorrere centinaia di esemplari.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Where people go, these Pokémon follow.\nIf you’re scattering food for them, be careful—\nseveral hundred of them can gather at once.",
